Milestone chips — provenance
============================

What:   12 milestone medallions in the sobriety-chip idiom (brushed-metal rim,
        beaded edge, engraved sunburst + guilloché field, laurel that gains
        layers with the milestone, the MyExodus leaf centre).
Tiers:  24 HOURS, 3 DAYS, 1 WEEK, 1 MONTH, 3 MONTHS, 6 MONTHS, 1 YEAR, 2 YEARS,
        5 YEARS, 10 YEARS, 20 YEARS, 30 YEARS.
Files:  svg/  — vector masters (512×512 viewBox, transparent)
        png/  — 512×512 transparent PNG renders (for the app / mockups)

Origin: original artwork generated by scripts/generate-milestone-chips.py
        (no third-party assets; the centre mark is logo_mark.png from the app).
Licence: same as the project. No Alcoholics Anonymous marks are used — the
        circle-and-triangle logo and "To Thine Own Self Be True" are AA
        trademarks ("Alcoholics Anonymous" is an AAWS mark), and retail chip
        artwork is copyrighted, so none of it is reproduced here.

Regenerate: python3 scripts/generate-milestone-chips.py
Rasterize:  the resvg recipe in that script's docstring (macOS qlmanage flattens
            SVG onto white — it cannot produce the transparent PNGs).
